  "2026-10-27T22:25:22.658Z","harness:codex","Primary public-registry metadata confirms latest SentryCLI3.8.2 age5.47days, marked18.1.2 age1.31days, TypeScriptESLint8.72.1 age1.22days, Stryker core+runner10.1.1 age4.13days, Knip6.43.0 age3.58days and Unicorn79 age4.24days. All are below seven days. Major owners remain pm-fokyhh for Vitest/coverage5.0.5 plus CodSpeed6.1.0, pm-t3jxjj for Sentry11, pm-do5b for TypeScript7 and pm-ksr40d for npm-package-arg14. Latest CodSpeed peers include Vitest5, as already recorded on its owner; compatibility/migration gates still need implementation. Current pnpm audit reports zero vulnerabilities across567 dependencies and GitHub has zero open dependency alerts or update PRs. Keep this intake open/unclaimed; no dependency version or policy is changed in the SDK input PR."
  "2026-10-28T15:37:34.581Z","harness:codex","Live October28 registry refresh: Sentry CLI3.8.2 age6.19days, marked18.1.2 age2.03days, typescript-eslint8.72.1 age1.93days, Stryker10.1.1 age4.84days, Greptile3.8.0 age1.71days, Knip6.43.0 age4.29days, Unicorn79 age4.96days and ext-apps2.0.4 age1.35days remain below seven-day cooldown. Existing major-migration owners remain separate. GitHub census finds zero open PRs and zero Dependabot, code-scanning or secret-scanning alerts. No dependency upgrade or policy bypass is justified in this context-read delivery."
